Give depth-only passes (SET_SURFACE_COLOR_TARGET NONE) a private scratch
colour target instead of replacing the surface at their stale colour offset,
and reload GPU surfaces when host code writes guest memory they cover
(queued from any thread). Together these fix WKC1's red cutscene flashes.
Also adds opt-in diagnostics: RSX_ENGINE_DRAW_CAPTURE, RSX_ENGINE_PRESENT_LOG
(stale presents, fps and GPU sync cost), RSX_ENGINE_FPS_FILE,
RSX_ENGINE_RED_TRIGGER and RSX_ENGINE_WATCH_TARGET.

